You may keep and pass on these files unchanged as part of a copy or fork of this project, and use the name and logos as TRADEMARKS.md allows. Any other use, including modifying the files or using them in another project, needs written permission from Matt Black (hello@inlaytrace.com).

The typefaces used in the logos are not included here and keep their own licenses. The wordmarks are drawn as outlines, so using the logo files needs no font.
